<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Cheong Ming suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Cheong Ming suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Cheong Ming Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Shares of the printing group rose HK$0.44 or 28.39 percent to HK$1.99 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
